<title>FINLAND: Helsinki resumes trade in UPM-Kymmene, Metsa-Serla.</title>
<headline>Helsinki resumes trade in UPM-Kymmene, Metsa-Serla.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in forestry shares UPM-Kymmene and Metsa-Serla resumed at 1205/1005 GMT, the Helsinki Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The two shares were briefly suspended pending news of asset deals between the companies.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 235</p>
</text>
